    "detailed_description": "<u><strong>A gun that shoots platforms!</strong></u><br>Platform Gun is a puzzle platformer where you shoot platforms with your gun that can be used for both traversal and combat. <br><br><i>Platform gun is a complete free experience that should take around 30 minutes to complete.</i><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore the Reinheart Space Station<br></li><li>Scale Heights with the Platform Gun<br></li><li>Glide to areas at incredible speed with the Platform Gun<br></li><li>Solve Puzzles with the Platform Gun<br></li><li>Use the Platform Gun to defeat enemies<br></li><li>Find Coins and Armor to make your escape easier</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527140/extras/6369ee12017a80955f669a53e9b92532.poster.avif?t=1694085545\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527140/extras/6369ee12017a80955f669a53e9b92532.webm?t=1694085545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527140/extras/6369ee12017a80955f669a53e9b92532.mp4?t=1694085545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
